WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Kneel and take the knees wide, big toes together.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Walk the hands forward and fold.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Rest the forehead on the mat or a block.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Arms reach forward or rest by the sides.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Breathe slowly, then rise.
